      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-19T13:22:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabk\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabk/48/1978_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabk:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Not really a baseball fan, but that update was enough to sucker me in. Can't resist more Sentinels stuff.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The game is a lot of fun even if you know nothing about baseball. I played with a guy from Australia at PAX East who had no clue what baseball was and had a great time. Played it at the bar too right on the counter which was awesome. I don't have many games that can \"travel\" like that.</p>",
